<title>GREECE: Greek September CPI figures due today.</title>
<headline>Greek September CPI figures due today.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's consumer price inflation for September will be released around midday, a National Statistics Service (NSS) official said.</p>
<p>An informal poll of Greek bankers and economists produced a mean forecast of 8.5 percent for September inflation, the same as in August. Forecasts ranged from 8.4 percent to 8.6 percent.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
